--- task
id: a03
dataset: attribution
kind: filter on an edge property
answer: fewest

--- intent
Which identities have a touchpoint that reached the source `$source` via `$via` (the `via` property of the touchpoint's link to its source)? Return their slugs.

--- params
{"source": "excluded", "via": "web"}

--- edition2
query identities_via($source: String, $via: String) {
  match {
    $s: Source { slug: $source }
    $t $e:touchpointOnSource $s
    $e.via = $via
    $t touchpointByIdentity $x
  }
  return { $x.slug }
}

--- edition3
query identities_via($source: String, $via: String) {
  match {
    $s: Source { slug: $source }
    $t $e:touchpointOnSource $s
    $e.via = $via
    $t touchpointByIdentity $x
  }
  return { $x.slug }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["x.slug"]
["x1"]
["x3"]
